 teach:["No smoking and no open flames near oxygen","Pursed-lip breathing during activity","Flu and pneumococcal vaccines","Bronchodilator before corticosteroid inhaler when both are scheduled together"],
 eval:{better:["Easier breathing, SpO₂ in target range, alert"],worse:["Rising RR, falling LOC, inability to speak"]},
