 first:{stem:"A client with emphysema is short of breath after walking to the bathroom. What should the nurse do first?",opts:["Have the client sit upright, lean forward, and use pursed-lip breathing","Increase the oxygen to 10 L/min","Obtain an ABG","Give a sedative to reduce anxiety"],key:0,why:"Positioning and pursed-lip breathing relieve air trapping immediately. Oxygen changes follow the order; sedatives depress breathing."}
