 red:["Decreasing LOC, vomiting, worsening headache (rising ICP)","Difficulty swallowing (aspiration risk)"],
 assess:["Time last known well","Neuro checks (LOC, pupils, motor strength, speech)","Swallow screen before any oral intake","Blood glucose (hypoglycemia can mimic stroke)"],
